set -euo pipefail

cat <<'TEXT'
SCWAP MODEL ROUTER ACTIVE.
Keep the current active model by default. Recommend a switch only when expected benefit is material.
Use the fast/cheap Claude model for reversible mechanical work: repo search, manifest checks, lint/tests, small docs, tiny path/config fixes, and no-change monitors.
Use the default Claude model for normal implementation and review.
Use the deep Claude model for genuinely complex or high-consequence work.
Route by complexity, consequence, reversibility, and ambiguity. Do not escalate solely because a task mentions money, legal, security, client-facing content, or external systems.
If the active model is wrong, state the exact model switch supported by this Claude Code install. SCWAP can advise; do not claim to switch silently.
TEXT
